# --- research artifacts -------------------------------------------------
# Runtime state and derived outputs are not committed; the market data the
# experiment runs on IS, so a clone reproduces the current state exactly.
#
# Paths are anchored to the repository root: an unanchored `data/` would also
# match `research/data/`, silently excluding the ingestion source code.
#
# Excluded: downloaded provider artifacts (large, re-fetchable), the resumable
# ingestion checkpoint (runtime state, and it records request URLs), and every
# derived result (regenerate with the CLI).
/data/ingest_cache/
/data/ingest_checkpoint.sqlite
/data/news/
/data/sentiment/
/data/calendar/
/data/ticks/
/results/
*.bi5

# Committed on purpose, so `pytest` and the CLI work straight from a clone:
#   data/source/*.csv       the supplied XAUUSD M15 export (primary source)
#   data/candles/*.parquet  the imported bars and the derived H4 trend feed
!/data/source/
!/data/source/*.csv
!/data/candles/
!/data/candles/*.parquet
